# NETRA chat backend (Vercel AI Gateway)
#
# Without this key, /api/chat has no upstream model to call and the bay
# runs in pure-local fallback (keyword retrieval over the archive,
# answers marked "resolved · NN entries · local · XXms") — it degrades
# honestly rather than erroring.
#
# Get a key from https://vercel.com/dashboard -> AI Gateway, or (preferred
# for this project, once it's linked to the Vercel project) pull the
# team-managed value directly:
#
#   vercel link && vercel env pull .env.local
AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
